OL,3,GNEWSASouthend United legend awarded    
OL,4,AFreedom of the City                    
OL,6,FA legendary ex-Southend United         
OL,7,Ffootballer has been awarded the Freedom
OL,8,Fof the City for his lifelong service to
OL,9,Fthe Shrimpers.                         
OL,11,FFrankie Banks was granted the          
OL,12,Fprestigious civic honour at a meeting  
OL,13,Fof Southend-on-Sea City Council on     
OL,14,FThursday evening.                      
OL,16,FThe 81-year-old's love affair with     
OL,17,FRoots Hall began in 1958 and has       
OL,18,Fcontinued for almost 60 years, in the  
OL,19,Fform of playing, coaching and community
OL,20,Foutreach roles.                        
